  "workspace": "Operation Center",
  "description": "Run by an analyst on a single alert. Gets the alert and its events, extracts file hashes (file.hash.* / process.hash.*, sha256/sha1/md5) and http(s) URLs (url.full, url.original), then runs two branches in parallel. Hash branch: looks up every hash in VMRay's existing analyses (no quota) and builds the full report for each sample found. URL branch: detonates the first URL (consumes quota, waits up to 30 min) and builds its report. Each branch posts its own comment and pushes hashes from malicious samples (child samples included) to an IOC collection. Before use: replace ioc_collection_id on both 'Add hashes to IOC Collection' nodes."
}
